<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <%- include('../partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="pb-header">
        <div class="pb-header-brand">
            <div class="pb-logo-mark">PB</div>
            <div>
                <div class="pb-logo-text">PORTAL ADMIN</div>
                <div class="pb-logo-name">Panel principal</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pb-user">
            <div class="pb-avatar"><%= (session.userName || 'A').charAt(0).toUpperCase() %></div>
            <div class="pb-user-info">
                <span class="pb-user-name"><%= session.userName || 'Administrador' %></span>
                <a href="/admin/logout" class="pb-user-link">Cerrar sesión</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pb-strip"></div>

    <main class="pb-main">
        <div style="margin-bottom: 28px;">
            <h1 style="margin: 0;">Hola, <%= session.userName || 'Administrador' %></h1>
            <p style="color: var(--neutral-500); margin: 6px 0 0;">Panel de administración del sistema Events.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;">

            <a href="/admin/solicitudes" class="pb-card pb-card-padded" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; transition: transform .12s, box-shadow .15s; display: block;">
                <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--state-warning-soft); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#8A4500" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><line x1="19" y1="8" x2="19" y2="14"/><line x1="22" y1="11" x2="16" y2="11"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px;">Gestión de ponentes</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--neutral-500); margin: 0;">Aprueba solicitudes de cuenta, gestiona ponentes activos.</p>
            </a>

            <a href="/admin/ponencias" class="pb-card pb-card-padded" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; transition: transform .12s, box-shadow .15s; display: block;">
                <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--brand-secondary-soft); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1E88E5" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px;">Propuestas de eventos</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--neutral-500); margin: 0;">Revisa, aprueba o rechaza las propuestas enviadas por los ponentes.</p>
            </a>

            <a href="/admin/calendar" class="pb-card pb-card-padded" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; transition: transform .12s, box-shadow .15s; display: block;">
                <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--state-success-soft); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1B5E20" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"/><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"/><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h3 style="margin: 0 0 6px;">Calendario</h3>
                <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--neutral-500); margin: 0;">Visualiza los eventos programados y disponibilidad de salas.</p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
